// Modules in a project (spec §10, Modules). `--fix` writes the error set an api.ctx's fn
// fails with (rule 5). A file the build program generates is in its executable's root (§19,
// rule 13), inside module game, and sees game's hidden helper. A test inside lib/gff tests
// its hidden check; one outside sees only its api.ctx (rule 6).
//# $ ctxc check --fix {dir}
